nitial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 14px;\">Please click on your bank account</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137422603/original/4soq6vW6g01uGj_bEyh_HHWE1SXsbkN6Iw.png?1629386393\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137422603\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Then click manual import in the top right hand corner</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137422839/original/aTuZOfL0hJJxm7K3X6s-XPBqnp2iJwTTWQ.png?1629386512\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137422839\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">please fill out the transactions as needed</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137422984/original/zP4eT7fmiypnoa_YNKpZdHolBopIqSlTug.png?1629386581\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137422984\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can delete rows by using the bin button</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137423064/original/nsGXL3EQh4X0_FokSV645kxSEA1LXoATzg.png?1629386606\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137423064\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can add rows by clicking the + Row button</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137423197/original/x4ztAgSOD9o031ZqOvz4R0JxDYiVC3oTlg.png?1629386634\" style=\"width: 148px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137423197\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Then click Save&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">These transactions will now sit on the dashboard. These are not reconciled</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please click here to find out how to reconcile transactions</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000165325-how-do-i-process-a-manual-bank-reconciliation-\">Manually</a></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000195198-auto-bank-reconciliation\">Automatically</a></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000204503-how-to-reconcile-multiple-transactions\">Multiple transactions</a></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137423438/original/IE687oYmfJ1tpqtctSavFkLy6KfFEv2-8Q.png?1629386728\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137423438\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205558\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205558/thumbs_